- Add deleteAudit() for single audit deletion (Art. 18, LGPD)
- Add deleteUserData() for full account deletion (right to be forgotten)
- Add deleteOldAudits() for automatic 90-day data retention cleanup
- Add daily cron job for data retention (runs at 03:00 UTC)
- Add audits.delete endpoint for individual audit deletion
- Add gdpr.deleteAccount endpoint for full account deletion
- Update README with 'Test in 3 Steps' section for non-technical users
- Add LGPD compliance section to README explaining data handling

All text follows norma-padrão brasileira with proper accentuation.
